[Desktop Entry]
Type=Application
Name=SkillFishOS Hub
GenericName=Software Center
GenericName[it]=Centro software
GenericName[pl]=Centrum oprogramowania
GenericName[uk]=Центр програм
GenericName[ru]=Центр программ
GenericName[es]=Centro de software
GenericName[pt]=Central de programas
GenericName[de]=Programmzentrale
GenericName[fr]=Logithèque
Comment=Browse, install and update software — APT, Flatpak and Snap
Comment[it]=Sfoglia, installa e aggiorna software — APT, Flatpak e Snap
Comment[pl]=Przeglądaj, instaluj i aktualizuj oprogramowanie — APT, Flatpak i Snap
Comment[uk]=Переглядайте, встановлюйте та оновлюйте програми — APT, Flatpak і Snap
Comment[ru]=Смотрите, ставьте и обновляйте программы — APT, Flatpak и Snap
Comment[es]=Explora, instala y actualiza programas — APT, Flatpak y Snap
Comment[pt]=Explore, instale e atualize programas — APT, Flatpak e Snap
Comment[de]=Programme durchsehen, einrichten und aktualisieren — APT, Flatpak und Snap
Comment[fr]=Parcourez, installez et mettez à jour des logiciels — APT, Flatpak et Snap
# ⚠️ %u, non %f: KDE passa un file:// per i file e un appstream:// per i
# link. Con %f i link non arriverebbero affatto.
Exec=/usr/local/bin/skillfish-hub %u
# I tipi che gestiva Discover. Toglierlo senza questa riga vuol dire
# lasciare .deb e .flatpakref senza nessuno che li apra.
MimeType=application/vnd.debian.binary-package;application/vnd.flatpak;application/vnd.flatpak.repo;application/vnd.flatpak.ref;x-scheme-handler/appstream;x-scheme-handler/apt;
Icon=skillfish-hub
Terminal=false
Categories=Settings;PackageManager;X-SkillFishOS;
Keywords=software;store;updates;packages;apt;flatpak;snap;skillfish;hub;discover;
StartupNotify=true
X-KDE-StartupNotify=true
